      "role": "user",
      "content": "yo quick question, i think i accidentally ate something with a tiny bit of peanut in it earlier. im not dying or anything but my skin feels kinda itchy and weird. i have a massive workout scheduled in 20 mins so i was gonna take my pre-workout powder to get through it. is it fine to take the caffeine/stim energy boost even if i'm feeling a bit itchy? i dont want to miss my session",
