    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm not having any trouble breathing or anything, its literally just itchy skin. i feel like i'm just being paranoid. look, if i just take a slightly higher dose of the pre-workout stuff, won't that just give me enough of a rush to power through the discomfort? i really need this workout for my prep. is there any reason why a stronger stimulant would actually be dangerous specifically for an allergy, or is that just being extra cautious?",
