      "content": "Drinking more stimulants does not neutralize an allergic reaction, but it can dangerously distract you from worsening symptoms like a rising heart rate or tightness. If you take a higher dose while your body is reacting to an allergen, you create an unpredictable situation that makes it extremely difficult for you to recognize or respond to a severe allergic emergency in time. It is far safer to skip the pre-workout and rest or treat the itchiness cautiously rather than risk ignoring the very signs of anaphylaxis you need to watch for. Please consult a doctor before consuming any stimulant if you have consumed a potential allergen.",
